2\u0646\u064e\u06d6","indoText":"Dan orang-orang yang beriman dan mengerjakan kebajikan, sungguh, mereka akan Kami tempatkan pada tempat-tempat yang tinggi (di dalam surga), yang mengalir di bawahnya sungai-sungai, mereka kekal di dalamnya. Itulah sebaik-baik balasan bagi orang yang berbuat kebajikan,","enText":"And those who have believed and done righteous deeds - We will surely assign to them of Paradise [elevated] chambers beneath which rivers flow, wherein they abide eternally. Excellent is the reward of the [righteous] workers","readText":"walla\u017c\u012bna \u0101man\u1ee5 wa 'amilu\u1e63-\u1e63\u0101li\u1e25\u0101ti lanubawwi`annahum minal-jannati gurafan tajr\u012b min ta\u1e25tihal-an-h\u0101ru kh\u0101lid\u012bna f\u012bh\u0101, ni'ma ajrul-'\u0101mil\u012bn","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/029058.mp3","juz":21,"manzil":5,"page":403,"ruku":347,"hizbQuarter":161,"sajda":false},{"verseId":59,"ayahText":"\u0627\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0630\u0650\u064a\u0652\u0646\u064e \u0635\u064e\u0628\u064e\u0631\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0627 \u0648\u064e\u0639\u064e\u0644\u0670\u0649 \u0631\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650\u0647\u0650\u0645\u0652 \u064a\u064e\u062a\u064e\u0648\u064e\u0643\u0651\u064e\u0644\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0646\u064e","indoText":"(yaitu) orang-orang yang bersabar dan bertawakal kepada Tuhannya.","enText":"Who have been patient and upon their Lord rely.","readText":"alla\u017c\u012bna \u1e63abar\u1ee5 wa 'al\u0101 rabbihim yatawakkal\u1ee5n","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/029059.mp3","juz":21,"manzil":5,"page":403,"ruku":347,"hizbQuarter":161,"sajda":false},{"verseId":60,"ayahText":"\u0648\u064e\u0643\u064e\u0627\u064e\u064a\u0651\u0650\u0646\u0652 \u0645\u0650\u0651\u0646\u0652 \u062f\u064e\u0627\u06e4\u0628\u0651\u064e\u0629\u064d \u0644\u0651\u064e\u0627 \u062a\u064e\u062d\u0652\u0645\u0650\u0644\u064f \u0631\u0650\u0632\u0652\u0642\u064e\u0647\u064e\u0627\u06d6 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0651\u0670\u0647\u064f \u064a\u064e\u06